    "description": "<p>Projects convincing holograms - anything from a fake roadblock to a charging monster.</p><p><em>Brad Turner's mask.</em> Wearing it gives +1 Toughness. Its power works only for the agent it's bonded to, a number of times per scene equal to their Speed.</p>",
