    "automation": {
      "status": "partial",
      "notes": "<p>Rolls Deception against each target's Cleverness; a hit leaves it Mesmerized by the illusion until the end of its next turn. What the hologram shows is up to the player. Speed uses per scene, only for the bonded wearer; +1 Toughness for any wearer.</p>"
